# Keeps the Docker build context small — server/Dockerfile's COPY . . would
# otherwise drag in .git history, every module's build/ output, and local
# Gradle/IDE caches, which is both slow to send to the daemon and can leak
# local.properties (API keys) into an image layer.
.git/
.gradle/
.kotlin/
**/build/
.idea/
*.iml
local.properties
keystore.properties
